    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Arriving is the strike.</em></p><p>When you move <strong>2 squares or more in a straight line</strong> in a turn and finish with a melee weapon strike, you may spend <strong>1 Ruin Charge</strong> as part of that strike. If you do:</p><ul><li>The strike's damage is also applied to every creature and breakable object in a <strong>1 square line directly behind your target</strong>, in your direction of travel. Each secondary target may make a Body defense check (DC 12 + your Initiation tier × 2) — on success, the secondary target takes half damage; on a failed check the full strike damage applies.</li><li>The original target is pushed <strong>2 squares</strong> in the direction of your charge (no save).</li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
